# Copy this file to `.env` (never commit `.env`).
# Everything below is optional for a clickable local desk. Only two things are
# needed to go live: XAI_API_KEY (drafts) and the Razorpay keys (wallet top-ups).

# --- AI: Grok only (xAI). Drafts fail closed with AI_UNAVAILABLE and nothing is charged when unset.
# XAI_API_KEY=
# Optional model overrides (defaults in src/lib/ai/models.ts):
# Consumer commission complaint file (long, structured):
# XAI_MODEL_RESEARCH=grok-4.20-0309-reasoning
# Grievance, RTI, appeals, NCH text, legal notice:
# XAI_MODEL_FAST=grok-4.20-0309-non-reasoning

# --- Wallet top-ups: Razorpay Standard Checkout (Orders API).
# Unset + no DATABASE_URL  -> "preview": top-ups are credited without payment (local only).
# Unset + DATABASE_URL     -> top-ups are refused ("payments not connected").
# Set                      -> real Checkout; the wallet is credited only after HMAC verification.
# Test keys (rzp_test_...) do not take real money. KEY_SECRET never reaches the browser.
# RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=
# RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET=
# Optional: webhook backstop for payment.captured / order.paid at /api/billing/razorpay
# RAZORPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET=

# --- Database. Unset = in-memory PGLite (wiped on restart). Deploy: Neon / any Postgres.
# DATABASE_URL=

# --- Auth (same Better Auth + Grok broker setup as CiteBench / GSTSlip).
# "false" turns off Google/X and uses a local dev user. Forbidden together with DATABASE_URL.
# VITE_AUTH_ENABLED=
# GROK_AUTH_ISSUER=
# GROK_AUTH_CLIENT_ID=
# GROK_AUTH_CLIENT_SECRET=
# BETTER_AUTH_URL=
# BETTER_AUTH_SECRET=
# Extra hosts allowed for OAuth callbacks (comma separated). arzidesk.ordereasy.win and *.ordereasy.win are built in.
# AUTH_ALLOWED_HOSTS=

# --- Admin desk (/admin): comma or space separated emails. Fails closed on a real
# database when empty; on the local PGLite preview any signed-in account may open it.
# ADMIN_EMAILS=you@example.com

# --- Daily automatic-first-appeal sweep (Vercel Cron calls /api/cron/auto-appeals
# at 09:00 IST with "Authorization: Bearer $CRON_SECRET"). Unset = route returns 401.
# CRON_SECRET=
